stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open: open (maker deposits tokens)
  Open --> Ready: set_ready (maker, before t0)
  Ready --> Locked: commit_claim (payout-key signature, before t1)
  Open --> Locked: commit_claim from t2 (punish path)
  Ready --> Locked: commit_claim from t2 (punish path)
  Locked --> Claimed: claim(a) within W of the lock
  Open --> Refunded: refund(b) before t0
  Open --> Refunded: refund(b) in t1..t2
  Ready --> Refunded: refund(b) in t1..t2
  Locked --> Refunded: refund(b) after W
  Claimed --> [*]: a is public, maker takes the ZEC
  Refunded --> [*]: b is public, taker recovers the ZEC
